  "privacy_html_content": "<div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Privacy Policy Website: vibesbox.app (As of: 28.01.2026)</h2></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 12px;\">1. Data Controller</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Responsible for data processing in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is:</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>VibesBox by Swen Steller</strong><br>Neefestr. 9<br>09119 Chemnitz<br>Germany<br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@vibesbox.app\">info@vibesbox.app</a></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">A data protection officer is currently not appointed in accordance with legal requirements.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 12px;\">2. General Information</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">We take the protection of your personal data very seriously. We treat your personal data confidentially and in accordance with legal data protection regulations and this privacy policy.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">It is generally possible to use our website without providing personal data. Where personal data (such as name, address, or email addresses) is collected on our pages, this is always done on a voluntary basis, where possible.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 12px;\">3. Hosting and Infrastructure</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">We host the content of our website and app with the following provider:</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Google Cloud</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">The provider is Google Ireland Limited, Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Purpose of processing:</strong> Provision and hosting of the technical infrastructure of our application and website.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Server log files:</strong> When accessing the website, Google automatically collects data that your browser transmits to us (IP address, date/time of access, etc.).</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Legal basis:</strong> Art. 6 para. 1 lit. f GDPR.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 12px;\">4. Contact</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">If you contact us by email or via a contact form, your information including the contact details you provide there will be stored for the purpose of processing your inquiry.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Legal basis:</strong> Art. 6 para. 1 lit. b GDPR.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 12px;\">5. Cookies</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Our website uses only technically necessary cookies.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Legal basis:</strong> Art. 6 para. 1 lit. f GDPR.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 12px;\">6. Link to VibesBox App</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">This website primarily serves as an information and reference portal for the \"VibesBox\" app. The separate privacy policy of the app applies, which can be viewed within the application.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 12px;\">7. Your Rights as a Data Subject</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">You have the right to information, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability, and objection. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the competent supervisory authority.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 12px;\">8. Currency and Changes</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">The current version can be accessed on this website at any time.</p></div>",
